e halfling artificer Ilin Derhin, who slew the Leviathan of the Sea of Thieves.;True Wand;26273g 7s 8c;18921g 1s 9c;This wand can be used as an arcane focus. If you can castsells with an arcane focus and use this wand for yoursells, yoursells require no material components that cost less than 1000g. Additionally, when you cast asell using this wand as your arcane focus, roll an ability check with yoursellcasting ability score. If you roll higher than 11 + thesell's level, you cast thesell without using asellslot. This fails if you have nosellslots remaining of thesell's level and therefore couldn't cast without succeeding.;Wand of Lightning Bolts;15086g 1c;11046g 8c;This wand can unleash powerful bolts of lightning upon command.;Whispering Wind Chime;73g 9s;51g 4s 5c; A set of wind chimes that emit soothing whispers when stirred by the breeze.;Whispersilk Cloak;184g 9s;140g 2s 8c; A cloak made of enchanted silk that muffles sound and grants the wearer increased stealth.
